==Strategy==
This stage introduces Dober P.D, a somewhat tanky enemy with a 33% chance to release a devastating wave attack into your front lines.  He is supported by an onslaught of Celeboodles, Ottas and Squire Rels. Due to the heavy peon spam, money should not be an issue and you are free to spam all of your units. However, do be wary that more meatshields will likely result in more waves being released by Dober, so balancing your flow of meatshields will be necessary to stall the enemies but prevent Dober from waving. Midranged area attackers like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris]] are highly recommended, and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut]] can be used to nuke huge chunks of the enemy front lines at once.

